#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unified Entity Model (v0.8)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:8
msgid ""
"FreeAnima stores most structured business data in a single **`entities`** "
"table. Self layer remains physically isolated in [`self_blocks`](self-"
"layer.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hierarchy: subject → world → content"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer       | Entity type     | Role                                                |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Subject** | `agent`, `user` | Who acts — exists **before** and **outside** worlds |\n"
"| **World**   | `world`         | Logical namespace / permission boundary             |\n"
"| **Content** | `content`       | Business data (tasks, future memory components, …)  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:18
msgid ""
"Subjects do **not** belong to a world. Each subject may have exactly **one "
"default private world** (exclusive, auto-created on subject creation). "
"Content belongs to a world via `world_id` and inherits that world's "
"visibility boundary."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two orthogonal classifications"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer           | Cardinality              | Purpose                                                    |\n"
"| --------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Entity type** | 4 fixed values           | Architecture boundary: `content`, `world`, `agent`, `user` |\n"
"| **Components**  | Dynamic, many per entity | Functional markers: `task_list`, `task_item`, …            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:27
msgid ""
"Component fields live in **`body` JSONB** at the top level. "
"**`primary_component`** records the creation entry (usually immutable); list "
"views route by primary component."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "`entities` table"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column                          | Role                                         |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`                            | `bigint` identity — global numeric ID        |\n"
"| `type`                          | One of four entity types                     |\n"
"| `world_id`                      | Native owning World (FK → `entities.id`)     |\n"
"| `components`                    | `text[]` component tags                      |\n"
"| `primary_component`             | Main component for module routing            |\n"
"| `title` / `summary` / `content` | Shared text columns (all components may use) |\n"
"| `body`                          | JSONB component payload                      |\n"
"| `created_at` / `updated_at`     | Timestamps                                   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Not in v0.8 bootstrap:** relationship table, permission table, World nesting/mount, graph DB (PostgreSQL AGE).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subject (`agent` / `user`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
