"**LLM:** ToolSet `vault` — metadata + `vault_inject_env` ack only; never "
"plaintext secrets in context."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:193
msgid ""
"**Config:** `vault(\"item_id\", \"field\")` resolves Agent library at Hub "
"boot (legacy `credential()` removed)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:195
msgid ""
"Legacy pass (`~/.password-store`) is **not** deleted on disk; migrate "
"entries manually via Shell UI."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:196 messages/po4a/en.xml:143
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:155 messages/po4a/en.xml:559
#, no-wrap
msgid "Search"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:199
msgid ""
"Entity **list** (deterministic browse) and **search** (relevance ranking) "
"are separate ports:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:204
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port                      | Role                                                                  |\n"
"| ------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `EntityStorePort.list`    | Structural filters; stable sort                                       |\n"
"| `EntitySearchPort.search` | Hard filters + optional text query; hybrid FTS/trigram/vector via RRF |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:206
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Scope:** default `world_id`; `global: true` requires an explicit accessible-world allowlist (public worlds only until subject permissions bootstrap).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:208
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Component filters:** whitelisted per `primary_component` (e.g. `task_item`: `status`, `list_id`, `tags`, `due_today`). Arbitrary JSONPath is forbidden.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:210
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Tools / API:** `entity_search` (LLM/MCP) and `hub().call(\"entity.searchGet\")` / `hub().call(\"entity.searchPost\")` (REST `GET /hub/rpc/v1/entity/searchGet` | `POST /hub/rpc/v1/entity/searchPost`) share `EntitySearchPort`. Task UI search box uses the same Hub RPC endpoint.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:212
msgid ""
"See memory hybrid search in [`memory.md`](memory.md) for FTS operator "
"syntax; entity search reuses the same query builder."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:214
#, no-wrap
msgid "**FTS index:** same `fts_segmented` + jieba write path as semantic memory (`resolveFtsSegmentedForWrite` on entity create/update). Legacy rows imported before this column may lack segmentation; run Console **FTS** rebuild (`onlyMissing`) to backfill `entities.fts_segmented` so jieba query tokens align with the GIN index.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:215
#, no-wrap
msgid "Future migration map (not executed yet)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/entity-model.md:226
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Legacy table                 | Target                                                                                                                     |\n"
